Hello, I can only write short sentences so far, but I'd really like to practise. What's a phrase I should learn first?\""}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "If you'd like to swap languages"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\"Hi, I saw you're learning English. I'm a native speaker. Shall we swap: I help with your English and you help with my Vietnamese?\""}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\"Hello! Your profile says you're learning French for work. I can help with that, and I'd love help with my Korean in return. Would that suit you?\""}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\"Hi, would you like to do half our chat in English and half in Vietnamese? What days are good for you?\""}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "If you've got something in common"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\"Hi! I saw you live in Da Nang. I'm visiting next year. What should I eat there?\""}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\"Hello, you mentioned you like football. Which team do people support where you live?\""}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\"Hi! We're both students. What's the hardest part of your course this year?\""}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\"I noticed you like cooking. What's a dish I should try to make from your country?\""}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "If you have a specific goal"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\"Hello, I'm preparing to study at a university in Vietnam. Could you help me write more formally?\""}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\"Hi, I need English for job interviews. Would you be willing to correct a few answers I've written?\""}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\"Hi, I write fine but I always use the same simple sentences. Could you show me how a native speaker would say them?\""}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\"Hello! I have one question about a sentence. Does this sound natural to you?\""}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Try it in the language you're learning"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Writing even one sentence in your target language shows effort, and it gives your partner something to correct straight away. For Vietnamese, you could try:"}]}, {"type": "blockquote", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chào anh, em tên là Tom. Em đang học tiếng Việt.", "marks": [{"type": "lang", "attrs": {"lang": "vi"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Hello, my name is Tom. I am learning Vietnamese. (To a man slightly older than you.)"}]}]}, {"type": "blockquote", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Bạn có thể sửa giúp mình câu này không?", "marks": [{"type": "lang", "attrs": {"lang": "vi"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Could you help me fix this sentence?"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "If you're not sure which words to use for \"I\" and \"you\", see our guide to "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Vietnamese pronouns", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "/blog/vietnamese-pronouns-explained"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Messages to avoid"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Just \"hi\" or \"hello\".", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " It gives them nothing to respond to."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Asking for a lot right away.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " \"Can you check my 10-page essay?\" is too much for a first message."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Compliments about their looks.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " This is a language exchange, not a dating site. Comments like these can make people uncomfortable, and they may block you."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Asking for personal details.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Don't ask for their phone number or social media account in the first message."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pasting the same message to everyone.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " People can tell. Change at least one detail."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "If nobody answers"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Don't take it personally. People get busy, or they may not be looking for a partner this week. Send a few personalised messages rather than just one, and don't send repeated follow-ups to the same person."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "What to do after they reply"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Answer soon, ask a question back, and agree how you'd like to work: how often you'll chat, and how much correcting you want. Then try saying it directly: \"Please correct me when something sounds unnatural.\" It's the single most useful sentence in a language exchange, and our guide explains "}, {"type": "text", "text": "how to get corrections from native speakers", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "/blog/corrections-from-native-speakers"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sending your first message on The Fluency Talks"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "On "}, {"type": "text", "text": "The Fluency Talks", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "/"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", your first message arrives as a request, and the other person can accept or decline it. That's why a clear, friendly opener matters. Matches are based on language, so you'll see native speakers of your target language and people learning yours, with perfect swaps first."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Create a free account", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "/signup"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " and try the first opener today."}]}]}$j$::jsonb, 4, now() - interval '7 minutes', now() - interval '7 minutes', now() - interval '7 minutes', now() - interval '7 minutes') on conflict (slug) do nothing;

insert into public.blog_posts (slug, draft, is_live, title, seo_title, description, kicker, summary, body, read_minutes, published_at, updated_at, created_at, draft_saved_at) values (
  'is-language-exchange-safe', $j${"title": "Is Language Exchange Safe? How to Spot Scams and Stay in Control", "seo_title": "Is Language Exchange Safe?", "description": "Language exchange is usually safe if you follow a few simple habits. Warning signs of scams, what never to share, and what to do if someone crosses a line.", "kicker": "Staying safe", "summary": "Language exchange is generally safe when you keep personal details private and stay wary of anyone who asks for money. Most partners just want to practise, but any place where strangers can message you attracts some bad actors. These warning signs will help you spot them early.", "cover_url": null, "cover_alt": null, "body": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The short answer"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Most language partners are exactly who they seem to be: people who want to practise. The risks are similar to those of any site where strangers can contact you. Those risks include scams, unwanted attention and people asking for too much personal information. You don't need to be fearful. You just need to know what to watch for and be ready to walk away."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Warning signs of a scam"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Be careful if a new contact does any of these things:"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Quickly moves the chat elsewhere.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " They press you to switch to another app within the first few messages. This can be a way of avoiding a platform's reporting tools."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Shows little interest in language.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " They never correct you, never practise and steer every conversation to other topics."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Brings up money or investing.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Stories of easy profits from cryptocurrency or trading are a well-known scam, and they often start with weeks of friendly chat."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Has a sudden emergency.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " A sick relative, a blocked bank account or a missed flight, followed by a request for money or gift cards."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Moves too fast emotionally.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Declarations of love or deep friendship after a few days can be part of a long-running scam."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sends links you weren't expecting.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Don't sign in or enter passwords on a page reached through a link from someone you've just met."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Offers a job or asks you to move money.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Requests to receive and pass on payments can involve you in crime."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "What never to share"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "It's easy to relax when a chat is going well, particularly when you're practising a language and trying to find the words. Keep these things to yourself:"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Your home address, or details of where you work or study that could identify you"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Bank details, card numbers or copies of your ID"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Passwords and one-time login codes"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Private photos of any kind"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Your travel plans, especially when your home will be empty"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Talking about your city, your hobbies or your job in general terms is usually enough for great conversation practice."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Trust your own comfort level"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You don't owe anyone a conversation. These are all acceptable, without any explanation:"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Not replying to a message request"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ending a chat that makes you uncomfortable"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Refusing to share your social media account or phone number"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Saying that you prefer to keep practice to the language"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Blocking someone"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "If you plan to meet in person"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Language partners do sometimes become friends, but take care if you decide to meet someone. Meet in a busy public place during the day, tell a friend where you're going and arrange your own transport. It's fine to change your mind at any time."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "What to do if something goes wrong"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Stop replying.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " You don't need to warn them or argue."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Keep the evidence.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Take screenshots before you block anyone, in case you need them later."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Report and block.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Use the tools on the site you're using, so that the same person can be stopped from approaching others."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "If you've lost money, act fast.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Contact your bank right away, and report it to the police."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "If you're afraid for your safety, contact local emergency services or the police.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Scammers are skilled at what they do, so being deceived doesn't mean you were foolish. Telling someone about it can stop it from happening to other people."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Safety on The Fluency Talks"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "No website can promise that everyone on it is honest, so your own judgement still matters. "}, {"type": "text", "text": "The Fluency Talks", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "/"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " gives you these tools:"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Message requests.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " A new contact's first message comes as a request, and you can decline it."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Blocking.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Blocked people can't see you or write to you."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Reporting.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " You can report anyone, and admins review reports."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Age limit.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " You must be 16 or older to create an account."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "No followers or likes.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " There's no popularity contest, and practice happens one to one in text."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Your data.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " You can export your data or delete your account at any time. Read our "}, {"type": "text", "text": "privacy policy", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "/privacy"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " for more information."}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "There's nothing to pay for: the service is free, with no paid plans. If anybody asks you to pay in order to use it, please report them."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ready to start, knowing what to watch for? Read "}, {"type": "text", "text": "what to say in your first message", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "/blog/first-message-to-language-partner"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", or check the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "full FAQ", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "/faq"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}}$j$::jsonb, true,
  $t$Is Language Exchange Safe? How to Spot Scams and Stay in Control$t$, $t$Is Language Exchange Safe?$t$, $t$Language exchange is usually safe if you follow a few simple habits. Warning signs of scams, what never to share, and what to do if someone crosses a line.$t$, $t$Staying safe$t$, $t$Language exchange is generally safe when you keep personal details private and stay wary of anyone who asks for money. Most partners just want to practise, but any place where strangers can message you attracts some bad actors. These warning signs will help you spot them early.$t$,
