h", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Talking about your city, your hobbies or your job in general terms is usually enough for great conversation practice."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Trust your own comfort level"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You don't owe anyone a conversation. These are all acceptable, without any explanation:"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Not replying to a message request"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ending a chat that makes you uncomfortable"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Refusing to share your social media account or phone number"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Saying that you prefer to keep practice to the language"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Blocking someone"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "If you plan to meet in person"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Language partners do sometimes become friends, but take care if you decide to meet someone. Meet in a busy public place during the day, tell a friend where you're going and arrange your own transport. It's fine to change your mind at any time."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "What to do if something goes wrong"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Stop replying.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " You don't need to warn them or argue."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Keep the evidence.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Take screenshots before you block anyone, in case you need them later."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Report and block.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Use the tools on the site you're using, so that the same person can be stopped from approaching others."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "If you've lost money, act fast.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Contact your bank right away, and report it to the police."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "If you're afraid for your safety, contact local emergency services or the police.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Scammers are skilled at what they do, so being deceived doesn't mean you were foolish. Telling someone about it can stop it from happening to other people."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Safety on The Fluency Talks"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "No website can promise that everyone on it is honest, so your own judgement still matters. "}, {"type": "text", "text": "The Fluency Talks", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "/"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " gives you these tools:"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Message requests.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " A new contact's first message comes as a request, and you can decline it."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Blocking.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Blocked people can't see you or write to you."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Reporting.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " You can report anyone, and admins review reports."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Age limit.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " You must be 16 or older to create an account."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "No followers or likes.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " There's no popularity contest, and practice happens one to one in text."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Your data.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " You can export your data or delete your account at any time. Read our "}, {"type": "text", "text": "privacy policy", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "/privacy"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " for more information."}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "There's nothing to pay for: the service is free, with no paid plans. If anybody asks you to pay in order to use it, please report them."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ready to start, knowing what to watch for? Read "}, {"type": "text", "text": "what to say in your first message", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "/blog/first-message-to-language-partner"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", or check the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "full FAQ", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "/faq"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}$j$::jsonb, 4, now() - interval '8 minutes', now() - interval '8 minutes', now() - interval '8 minutes', now() - interval '8 minutes') on conflict (slug) do nothing;

insert into public.blog_posts (slug, draft, is_live, title, seo_title, description, kicker, summary, body, read_minutes, published_at, updated_at, created_at, draft_saved_at) values (
  'text-or-video-language-exchange', $j${"title": "Text or Video Language Exchange: Which Is Better for Beginners?", "seo_title": "Text or Video Language Exchange?", "description": "Should beginners start a language exchange in text or on video? An honest comparison of what each one trains, who it suits, and how to combine them.", "kicker": "Language exchange basics", "summary": "For most beginners, text is the easier place to start, because you have time to think and every correction stays on the screen. Video is better for listening and pronunciation, which text can't teach. Neither one is enough alone, so choose based on your current goal, and aim to use both over time.", "cover_url": null, "cover_alt": null, "body": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A quick disclosure"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The Fluency Talks is a text-only language exchange, so you should know that we have a side in this debate. We chose text for reasons we explain below, but we'll also tell you plainly what it can't do."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "What text does well"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "It gives you time to think.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " You can look up a word, build your sentence and check it before you send it. That makes it possible to say more than you could on the spot."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Corrections are easy to see.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " When someone fixes a spoken sentence, the moment passes quickly. A written correction stays there for you to read again next week."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "It reduces anxiety.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Plenty of learners freeze on camera. Nobody can see you hesitate in a chat."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "It trains your writing and spelling.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " That's particularly valuable if you need the language for study or work, or for a new alphabet. In Vietnamese, for example, you practise tone marks with every message."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "It fits your life.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " You can reply on the bus, and your partner can reply tomorrow from a different time zone. There's no need to book a time."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "It needs little data.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Text works even on a slow connection, or in a place where you can't talk out loud."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "What video does well"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Listening.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " You get used to real speed, real accents and sounds running together."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pronunciation.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " A partner can hear your errors and tell you about them. Text can't do this, and in a tonal language it's especially important."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Speaking without a safety net.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Thinking quickly and carrying on when you lack a word are skills you only build by doing them."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Personal connection.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Faces and voices can help you build a friendship and stay motivated."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Comparing the two"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Thinking time:", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " plenty in text, very little on video."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Remembering corrections:", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " easy in text, harder on video unless you take notes."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Listening and pronunciation:", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " not covered by text, well covered by video."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Scheduling:", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " flexible in text, must be arranged for video."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Nerves for beginners:", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " usually low in text, often high on video."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Internet needed:", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " very little for text, a stable connection for video."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Which is best for you?"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Start with text if:"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You're at A1 or A2, and speaking feels overwhelming"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You're shy, or you worry about making mistakes in front of someone"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Your main goal is writing, such as exams, emails or essays"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You have an unpredictable schedule, or you have a poor connection"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Prioritise voice or video if:"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You can already write comfortably, but you freeze when you speak"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You have a speaking test or job interview coming up"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You're learning a tonal language and nobody has checked your tones"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You're moving soon, and you need to understand people right away"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "How to combine them"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Text can also help you prepare for speaking. Try this simple routine:"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Write it first.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Use chat to work out how to tell a story from your week, and get it corrected."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Read it aloud.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Say the corrected version several times."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Listen to the real thing.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Use podcasts, videos or music in your language to train your ear."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Use it out loud.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Try the same story with a tutor, a friend or a local speaker, using whichever voice tool or meeting suits you."}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You will speak with more confidence because you've already practised the words. For an example of why you need both, see the challenges of "}, {"type": "text", "text": "studying at a university in Vietnamese", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "/blog/studying-at-university-in-vietnam"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", where listening and exam writing are both needed."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Why we built The Fluency Talks around text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "We wanted every correction to be visible and useful. On "}, {"type": "text", "text": "The Fluency Talks", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "/"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", a partner edits your sentence where you wrote it, you see the changes in red and green, and the corrections you accept go into your phrasebook. You can review them whenever you like, which is hard to do with something said in a call."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "We don't offer voice or video calls, so if speaking practice is your only goal, we're not the right tool on our own. If you'd like a calm place to write, get corrected and build confidence, it's free. "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Find a language partner", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "/signup"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", or read our "}, {"type": "text", "text": "FAQ", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "/faq"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " to see how it all works."}]}]}}$j$::jsonb, true,
  $t$Text or Video Language Exchange: Which Is Better for Beginners?$t$, $t$Text or Video Language Exchange?$t$, $t$Should beginners start a language exchange in text or on video? An honest comparison of what each one trains, who it suits, and how to combine them.$t$, $t$Language exchange basics$t$, $t$For most beginners, text is the easier place to start, because you have time to think and every correction stays on the screen. Video is better for listening and pronunciation, which text can't teach. Neither one is enough alone, so choose based on your current goal, and aim to use both over time.$t$,
