e bus, and your partner can reply tomorrow from a different time zone. There's no need to book a time."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "It needs little data.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Text works even on a slow connection, or in a place where you can't talk out loud."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "What video does well"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Listening.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " You get used to real speed, real accents and sounds running together."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pronunciation.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " A partner can hear your errors and tell you about them. Text can't do this, and in a tonal language it's especially important."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Speaking without a safety net.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Thinking quickly and carrying on when you lack a word are skills you only build by doing them."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Personal connection.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Faces and voices can help you build a friendship and stay motivated."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Comparing the two"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Thinking time:", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " plenty in text, very little on video."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Remembering corrections:", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " easy in text, harder on video unless you take notes."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Listening and pronunciation:", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " not covered by text, well covered by video."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Scheduling:", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " flexible in text, must be arranged for video."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Nerves for beginners:", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " usually low in text, often high on video."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Internet needed:", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " very little for text, a stable connection for video."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Which is best for you?"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Start with text if:"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You're at A1 or A2, and speaking feels overwhelming"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You're shy, or you worry about making mistakes in front of someone"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Your main goal is writing, such as exams, emails or essays"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You have an unpredictable schedule, or you have a poor connection"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Prioritise voice or video if:"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You can already write comfortably, but you freeze when you speak"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You have a speaking test or job interview coming up"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You're learning a tonal language and nobody has checked your tones"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You're moving soon, and you need to understand people right away"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "How to combine them"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Text can also help you prepare for speaking. Try this simple routine:"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Write it first.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Use chat to work out how to tell a story from your week, and get it corrected."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Read it aloud.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Say the corrected version several times."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Listen to the real thing.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Use podcasts, videos or music in your language to train your ear."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Use it out loud.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Try the same story with a tutor, a friend or a local speaker, using whichever voice tool or meeting suits you."}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You will speak with more confidence because you've already practised the words. For an example of why you need both, see the challenges of "}, {"type": "text", "text": "studying at a university in Vietnamese", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "/blog/studying-at-university-in-vietnam"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", where listening and exam writing are both needed."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Why we built The Fluency Talks around text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "We wanted every correction to be visible and useful. On "}, {"type": "text", "text": "The Fluency Talks", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "/"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", a partner edits your sentence where you wrote it, you see the changes in red and green, and the corrections you accept go into your phrasebook. You can review them whenever you like, which is hard to do with something said in a call."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "We don't offer voice or video calls, so if speaking practice is your only goal, we're not the right tool on our own. If you'd like a calm place to write, get corrected and build confidence, it's free. "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Find a language partner", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "/signup"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", or read our "}, {"type": "text", "text": "FAQ", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "/faq"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " to see how it all works."}]}]}$j$::jsonb, 4, now() - interval '9 minutes', now() - interval '9 minutes', now() - interval '9 minutes', now() - interval '9 minutes') on conflict (slug) do nothing;
